 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "AI is a powerful tool.",
   "start": 0.77,
   "end": 3.29
  },
  {
   "text": "But you don't need it for everything.",
   "start": 3.29,
   "end": 5.67
  },
  {
   "text": "A normal day. Five tasks.",
   "start": 5.67,
   "end": 8.4
  },
  {
   "text": "And the same reflex every time: use AI.",
   "start": 8.4,
   "end": 12.48
  },
  {
   "text": "Add up three invoices?",
   "start": 12.48,
   "end": 14.18
  },
  {
   "text": "No need for AI. A calculator is faster.",
   "start": 14.18,
   "end": 17.56
  },
  {
   "text": "Check the cold chain procedure?",
   "start": 17.56,
   "end": 19.4
  },
  {
   "text": "MSF already wrote it down. Go to the guideline.",
   "start": 19.4,
   "end": 22.83
  },
  {
   "text": "A two-line reply? Just type it.",
   "start": 22.83,
   "end": 25.35
  },
  {
   "text": "Asking AI would take longer.",
   "start": 25.35,
   "end": 27.67
  },
  {
   "text": "A colleague's evaluation? That needs you:",
   "start": 27.67,
   "end": 30.62
  },
  {
   "text": "your judgement, your words, your relationship.",
   "start": 30.62,
   "end": 34.26
  },
  {
   "text": "A forty-page report to summarise?",
   "start": 34.26,
   "end": 36.56
  },
  {
   "text": "Now AI earns its place.",
   "start": 36.56,
   "end": 38.94
  },
  {
   "text": "AI can save you time, but you must always check it before you use it.",
   "start": 38.94,
   "end": 43.92
  },
  {
   "text": "So, before you use AI, ask yourself four questions.",
   "start": 43.92,
   "end": 48.57
  },
  {
   "text": "A simpler tool? Already written down?",
   "start": 48.57,
   "end": 51.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Does it need me? Quicker to do it myself?",
   "start": 51.12,
   "end": 53.95
  },
  {
   "text": "Four times no? Then AI can help.",
   "start": 53.95,
   "end": 57.18
  },
  {
   "text": "Sensitive, about a person, or unsure? Pause and ask.",
   "start": 57.18,
   "end": 62.22
  },
  {
   "text": "You will find everything else on the MSF AI Hub.",
   "start": 62.22,
   "end": 66.21
  }
 ]
}